  "contract": "Hellsmelted Armor is CharacterAdvancement 6620 (Defiance) with ranks 706569 and 707836. Rank 1 reads 'Each Hellfire Imp active now increases your chance to block by $302546s1%. In addition, increases your chance to block by $s2% at all times.'; rank 2 reads the same with $302546s2%. In Spell.dbc both ranks carry two SPELL_AURA_MOD_BLOCK_PERCENT (51) effects: effect 0 BasePoints -1 DieSides 1 = 0 and effect 1 = 5 (rank 1) or 10 (rank 2). Hellfire Imp Hidden Aura 302546 resolves s1 = 1 (BasePoints 0, DieSides 1) and s2 = 2 (BasePoints 1, DieSides 1); its two SPELLMOD_EFFECT1 effects target rank 1 (class mask dword2 0x8000) and rank 2 (dword0 0x10000) respectively. Expected: rank 1 blocks +5% always and +1% per living imp, rank 2 blocks +10% always and +2% per living imp, and the per-imp part ends with the imps (805966 lasts 12 sec). A rank above 1 replaces the lower rank spell (SetTalentRank), and the server chain of 706569 comes from Talent.dbc 35742 (706569 -> 706570), so rank 2 707836 is not in it. Each knight holds a shield (Block 107, shield proficiency 9116), and Defense is pinned at its level-60 maximum (300), so block_chance reads the unclamped native block percentage; each Call: Hellfire Imp (804883) cast summons one imp.",
